Z||000000||fieroshop||07-25-2000||01:18 AM||||Just picked up an 88 coupe today and aside from needing paint the cpe is in excellent condition. This will make the 3rd cpe in our soon to be rental fleet. Joining this fleet is an 84 cpe with 70K miles and an 87 cpe auto.<BR>I hope to be able to have some of these fieros available within the next 2 to 3 weeks. I never thought that I would own so many at the same time, but as the saying goes the man with the most toys......... <BR>I also have four ather fieros that I will be restoring and are or will be for sale not counting that I also have six parts cars. Am I having fun or what? I retired several years past (to be precise I retired in 1985)and decided to have some fun and I'm there. I mean where else can a person who likes fieros as I do have a job where for me is play all day long.<BR>Oh! I forgot, the wife drives an 86 GT and I have the 88GT shown by my signature. I've got to many to count.<P>------------------<BR> <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by fieroshop (edited 07-25-2000).]||||reg||6
